# Predator Ooze: "Whenever a creature dealt damage by this creature this turn dies, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature" (CR 603.2,
# 603.3, 510.1). Attacking on turn 3 it gets its counter and is a 2/2; Bot2's two Llanowar Elves block it together, and it deals 1 to
# each (the engine's division, lethal to each in turn). Both die at once, so the ability triggers once for each - two more counters, a
# 4/4. The Elves' 2 damage does not destroy the indestructible Ooze (CR 702.12b).

